   "Initiated coverage of Standard Nuclear (STDN) with a Buy rating and $18 12-month price target, implying 120% upside.",
   "STDN is the only domestic industrial-scale supplier of TRISO fuel, a specialized nuclear fuel for microreactors and SMRs with higher safety and burn-up rates.",
   "Forecasts global SMR capacity to grow from near-zero today to ~46 GW by 2045, with TRISO-based reactors capturing ~25% of the SMR market.",
   "STDN maintains a near-monopoly position in TRISO manufacturing, with capacity expected to reach 30 MTU/yr by 2030, up from ~2.5 MTU/yr today.",
   "The company has a capital-light business model and is expected to reach ~65% EBITDA margins by 2030, with positive FCF starting in 2028.",
   "STDN has a $660mn backlog and $2.6bn pipeline, providing strong revenue visibility through 2030.",
   "Near-term growth is driven by government/military microreactor applications, which benefit from reduced licensing hurdles compared to commercial NRC-licensed projects.",
